  "question": {
    "text": "A ray of light, travelling in medium A, is incident on plane interface of two media A and B and gets refracted into medium B. The angle of incidence is i and that of refraction is r. Graph between sin(i) and sin(r) is as shown in diagram. The correct statement among the following is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0050_8c4bb10ec4bb.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 133px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Speed of light in medium B is three fourth of that in medium A",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Total internal reflection can take place",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Refraction index of medium A is greater than that of medium B",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "None of these",
      "is_correct": false
    }
